<h1>The profile editor has moved to GJUBoard</h1>
<p>The editor is now a standalone page with browser storage and JSON import/export.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://hamza928505.github.io/GJUYearKit/editor.html">Open the GJUBoard editor</a></p>
<p>If you have an old draft in this browser, download it here, then choose <strong>Load .json</strong> in GJUBoard. Open this page at the same address and in the same browser you used before; drafts belong to that browser and origin.</p>
<p><button class="btn" type="button" data-export-draft>Download old browser draft</button></p>
<p data-export-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Downloading leaves your old draft and attachments intact.</p>
<noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to download a saved browser draft.</p></noscript>
<p>To update this profile site, export JSON from GJUBoard and run <code>npm run import-data -- &lt;file&gt;</code> in CareerToAI, then build and publish as usual.</p>
<p>For a local copy, serve the GJUBoard folder with a static server and open <code>editor.html</code>.</p>
